# Normalize line endings to LF everywhere, in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# Not just tidiness: generated files (card tables, eval reports) are compared byte for
# byte. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would get CRLF while the generators
# emit LF, so a check would pass on Linux CI and fail locally. A check whose result
# depends on the developer's OS is worse than no check.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
